### Tone: End-of-game award: Bullseye, the most answers within ten percent of the truth. $count: those answers (≥ 1).
### Suspicious admiration: she half suspects they looked it up.

award-bullseye-1 =
    The Bullseye award goes to { $name }: { $count ->
        [one] one answer
       *[other] { $count } answers
    } within a whisker of the truth. I have questions. Mostly about your browser history.
award-bullseye-2 = { $name }, the sharpest aim in the room. I’m told that’s a compliment. I’m passing it on unopened.
award-bullseye-3 =
    { $name } landed { $count ->
        [one] a bullseye.
       *[other] { $count } bullseyes.
    } Either a gifted estimator, or someone who reads the back of cereal boxes. Both are concerning.
award-bullseye-4 = Bullseye: { $name }. Accuracy noted. Smugness, I assume, already in progress.
award-bullseye-5 =
    { $name }: { $count ->
        [one] once
       *[other] { $count } times
    } within ten percent. That’s precision. Or luck wearing a lab coat.
award-bullseye-6 = The award for getting uncomfortably close to the truth goes to { $name }. Please step back from the truth.
award-bullseye-7 = { $name } hit the target. I’ve marked the target as compromised.
award-bullseye-8 =
    { $count ->
        [one] One bullseye
       *[other] { $count } bullseyes
    } for { $name }. I’ve run the numbers. The numbers are annoyed.
award-bullseye-9 = Bullseye: { $name }. Remarkable. I’ll be checking whether you had a phone in your other hand.
award-bullseye-10 = { $name }, closest to the truth more often than anyone. I hope you’re proud. I’m not. But I hope you are.
award-bullseye-11 = Bullseye: { $name }. You hit the truth so often, it has filed a complaint.
award-bullseye-12 =
    { $name }, { $count ->
        [one] one answer
       *[other] { $count } answers
    } within ten percent. I’ve updated my threat assessment.
award-bullseye-13 = The Bullseye goes to { $name }. Please empty your pockets. Slowly. Show me there are no encyclopaedias.
award-bullseye-14 = { $name }, sharpest estimator in the room. I find it unsettling when humans are right. It doesn’t suit you.
award-bullseye-15 =
    { $count ->
        [one] One direct hit
       *[other] { $count } direct hits
    } from { $name }. The target has asked to be moved.
